{"title": "Dead Eyes", "pageid": 42765, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Dead_Eyes", "categories": ["Factions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Dead Eyes</b> are a group of mercenaries residing in the <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate\" title=\"Baldur's Gate\">Baldur's Gate</a> during <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Three\" title=\"Act Three\">Act Three</a>.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Act_Three\">Act Three</span></h3>\n<p>The Dead Eyes are only be encountered in <a href=\"/wiki/Old_Garlow%27s_Place\" title=\"Old Garlow's Place\">Old Garlow's Place</a> if the party do not complete <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Save_Mayrina\" title=\"Save Mayrina\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Save Mayrina\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Save_Mayrina\" title=\"Save Mayrina\">Save Mayrina</a> during <a href=\"/wiki/Act_One\" title=\"Act One\">Act One</a>. As a result, Mayrina does not establish the <a href=\"/wiki/Anti-Hag_Support_Group\" title=\"Anti-Hag Support Group\">Anti-Hag Support Group</a>, and the Dead Eyes take their place instead.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Members\">Members</span></h2>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r347748\">.mw-parser-output .div-